{"type":"text","timestamp":1790383965740,"sessionID":"ses_f24d08c96ffe144V31TPpsDo1Z","part":{"id":"prt_0db334603001Fp2yOl88I0HgnW","messageID":"msg_0db3306fc0013yInsxorGAIGrl","sessionID":"ses_f24d08c96ffe144V31TPpsDo1Z","type":"text","text":"The project is a minimal scaffold: the minimap script is unattached, and mob/crate integration is entirely TODO. I’ll wire the scene and implement marker lifecycle defensively, including zoom recalculation and deferred setup so the `TextureRect` has its final size.","time":{"start":1790383965699,"end":1790383965702},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0c5303fd1edfb449016ab7175cc4448196a8a19d0f686075e6","phase":"commentary"}}}}
