{"type":"text","timestamp":1790384222281,"sessionID":"ses_f24d08c96ffe144V31TPpsDo1Z","part":{"id":"prt_0db373043001aw9Y07d3AMahoG","messageID":"msg_0db36ae2b0010MT6rJ3VOX6JCq","sessionID":"ses_f24d08c96ffe144V31TPpsDo1Z","type":"text","text":"The non-movie headless run exits cleanly. I found one behavioral correction before final verification: marker offsets must be rotated by the inverse player rotation, while `grid_scale` should represent grid-to-viewport scale and zoom should multiply the relative offset. I’m applying that so the minimap tracks orientation correctly.","time":{"start":1790384222275,"end":1790384222276},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0c5303fd1edfb449016ab718583cac819687bb5db09f3241ee","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790384222300,"sessionID":"ses_f24d08c96ffe144V31TPpsDo1Z","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_iofGmNpPkxYHWvy9XXxAsUOP","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/scripts/minimap.gd\n@@\n \tfor object in markers.keys():\n \t\tif not is_instance_valid(object):\n \t\t\t_on_object_removed(object)\n \t\t\tcontinue\n \n \t\tvar marker: Sprite2D = markers[object]\n-\t\tvar marker_position: Vector2 = \\\n-\t\t\t(object.global_position - player.global_position) * grid_scale + grid_center\n+\t\tvar marker_position: Vector2 = (object.global_position - player.global_position) \\\n+\t\t\t* grid_scale * zoom\n+\t\tmarker_position = grid_center + marker_position.rotated(-player.rotation)\n@@\n func _update_grid_scale() -> void:\n-\tgrid_scale = grid.size / (get_viewport_rect().size * zoom)\n+\tgrid_scale = grid.size / get_viewport_rect().size\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM workspace/scripts/minimap.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/scripts/minimap.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/scripts/minimap.gd\n+++ /workspace/scripts/minimap.gd\n@@ -48,10 +48,11 @@\n \t\t\t_on_object_removed(object)\n \t\t\tcontinue\n \n \t\tvar marker: Sprite2D = markers[object]\n-\t\tvar marker_position: Vector2 = \\\n-\t\t\t(object.global_position - player.global_position) * grid_scale + grid_center\n+\t\tvar marker_position: Vector2 = (object.global_position - player.global_position) \\\n+\t\t\t* grid_scale * zoom\n+\t\tmarker_position = grid_center + marker_position.rotated(-player.rotation)\n \t\tif grid_rect.has_point(marker_position):\n \t\t\tmarker.scale = Vector2.ONE\n \t\telse:\n \t\t\tmarker.scale = Vector2.ONE * 0.75\n@@ -59,9 +60,9 @@\n \t\tmarker.position = marker_position\n \n \n func _update_grid_scale() -> void:\n-\tgrid_scale = grid.size / (get_viewport_rect().size * zoom)\n+\tgrid_scale = grid.size / get_viewport_rect().size\n \n \n func _on_object_removed(object: Node) -> void:\n \tif not markers.has(object):\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/workspace/scripts/minimap.gd","relativePath":"workspace/scripts/minimap.gd","type":"update","patch":"Index: /workspace/scripts/minimap.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/scripts/minimap.gd\n+++ /workspace/scripts/minimap.gd\n@@ -48,10 +48,11 @@\n \t\t\t_on_object_removed(object)\n \t\t\tcontinue\n \n \t\tvar marker: Sprite2D = markers[object]\n-\t\tvar marker_position: Vector2 = \\\n-\t\t\t(object.global_position - player.global_position) * grid_scale + grid_center\n+\t\tvar marker_position: Vector2 = (object.global_position - player.global_position) \\\n+\t\t\t* grid_scale * zoom\n+\t\tmarker_position = grid_center + marker_position.rotated(-player.rotation)\n \t\tif grid_rect.has_point(marker_position):\n \t\t\tmarker.scale = Vector2.ONE\n \t\telse:\n \t\t\tmarker.scale = Vector2.ONE * 0.75\n@@ -59,9 +60,9 @@\n \t\tmarker.position = marker_position\n \n \n func _update_grid_scale() -> void:\n-\tgrid_scale = grid.size / (get_viewport_rect().size * zoom)\n+\tgrid_scale = grid.size / get_viewport_rect().size\n \n \n func _on_object_removed(object: Node) -> void:\n \tif not markers.has(object):\n","additions":4,"deletions":3}],"diagnostics":{},"truncated":false},"title":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM workspace/scripts/minimap.gd","time":{"start":1790384222279,"end":1790384222291}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0c5303fd1edfb449016ab7185984f08196a82e122a9463914c"}},"id":"prt_0db373045001foi64yallBegrI","sessionID":"ses_f24d08c96ffe144V31TPpsDo1Z","messageID":"msg_0db36ae2b0010MT6rJ3VOX6JCq"}}
